7 Awarding, grading and reporting

Vocational Awards are awarded on an 8-point scale: Level 2 Distinction*, Level 2 Distinction, Level 2
Merit, Level 2 Pass, Level 1 Distinction*, Level 1 Distinction, Level 1 Merit, Level 1 Pass. Candidates
who do not achieve the uniform marks required to achieve a Level 1 Pass will have their achievement
recorded as U (unclassified) and will not receive a certificate.

